flowchart TD
    A[Player selects difficulty] --> B[Streamlit app initializes game state]
    B --> C[Player enters a guess]
    C --> D[parse_guess validates numeric input]
    D -->|Invalid| E[Display error without consuming attempt]
    E --> C
    D -->|Valid| F[Record attempt and guess history]
    F --> G[check_guess compares guess with secret]
    G --> H[update_score calculates score]
    H --> I[Display hint and win or loss status]
    I -->|Still playing| C
    I --> J[New Game resets session state]
    J --> B
